 runner, so both suite lanes have silently failed on\nevery scheduled run since the Zig 0.16 migration — no scheduled suite\nevidence exists for that period.\n\nReproduced red→green locally with a fresh global cache via\nXDG_CACHE_HOME: without the hook mkdir the conformance build dies with\nthe exact CI error; with it, the full fetch, jar install, and chain\npatch complete. The mkdir is a no-op once the pinned zig carries the\nupstream fix; the comment in shared.nix says to drop it then.","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:21:43Z","author":{"name":"Matt Robenolt","email":"m@robenolt.com"},"committer":{"name":"Matt Robenolt","email":"m@robenolt.com"}},"repository":{"id":1252016105,"node_id":"R_kgDOSqA_6Q","name":"ztls","full_name":"mattrobenolt/ztls","private":false,"owner":{"login":"mattrobenolt","id":375744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/375744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt","html_url":"https://github.com/mattrobenolt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattrobenolt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/mattrobenolt/ztls","description":"Sans-I/O TLS 1.3 state machine in Zig. No sockets, no engine allocations, caller-owned buffers. Pre-alpha.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattrobenolt/ztls","for